							<div  class="fluid-cell intro no-b-padding">

								
																	<h2 class="" >Stories of Generosity Map</h2>
								
																	<p class="p-large">Explore stories of generosity from around the world and see how people and organizations give, volunteer, and take action in their communities on GivingTuesday and all year long.</p>
								
							</div>

						


