																									<p class="p-large invert">“GivingTuesday exists to build the world we all imagine to be possible. A world where everyone has what they need; a world built on a sense of community and abundance.”</p>
												
																									<div class="p-small invert opacity">- GivingTuesday Chicago leader</div>
												
											</div>

										
											<div class="slide w-slide">

																									<p class="p-large invert">“Being a part of GivingTuesday’s global leader network gives me energy for my own work.  The diversity and breadth of leaders offers a spiritual push.”</p>
												
																									<div class="p-small invert opacity">- Becky Nickel, Peabody, Kansas</div>
												
											</div>

										
											<div class="slide w-slide">

																									<p class="p-large invert">“What we have learned from GivingTuesday is the resilience and the spirit of organizations and people who do not give up despite the circumstances. ”</p>
												
